WEBVTT

00:00:07.608 --> 00:00:08.932
<v><b>Taxi driver:</b></v> Where to ma’am?

00:00:09.866 --> 00:00:10.574
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> Hello.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.578
To the airport, please.

00:00:12.787 --> 00:00:14.506
<v><b>Taxi driver:</b></v> JFK or Newark?

00:00:14.911 --> 00:00:16.490
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> JFK, please.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:23.655
Oh dear.

00:00:23.999 --> 00:00:26.432
The traffic is bad this morning.

00:00:26.769 --> 00:00:27.951
<v><b>Taxi driver:</b></v> Yes. It’s terrible.

00:00:28.854 --> 00:00:29.677
Where are you from?

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:33.643
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> I’m from Manchester but I live in London.

00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:36.193
Are you from New York?

00:00:36.448 --> 00:00:38.890
<v><b>Taxi driver:</b></v> No, ma’am, I’m from Puerto Rico.

00:00:39.366 --> 00:00:41.754
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> Oh, do you like New York?

00:00:41.878 --> 00:00:44.804
<v><b>Taxi driver:</b></v> It’s a great city, but it’s very expensive.

00:00:45.134 --> 00:00:47.421
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> London is very expensive, too.

00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:49.578
Do you have children?

00:00:50.055 --> 00:00:51.460
<v><b>Taxi driver:</b></v> I have two daughters.

00:00:51.638 --> 00:00:52.735
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> Oh really?

00:00:53.269 --> 00:00:55.996
I have two sons and a daughter.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:00.568
David and Andrew are at university, and Carla’s at school…

00:01:10.123 --> 00:01:11.794
<v><b>Taxi driver:</b></v> OK. Here we are.

00:01:12.154 --> 00:01:13.062
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> How much is that?

00:01:13.331 --> 00:01:15.984
<v><b>Taxi driver:</b></v> That’s $87.50.

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:18.449
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> Oh. Here’s $100.

00:01:18.622 --> 00:01:19.556
Keep the change.

00:01:19.676 --> 00:01:21.868
<v><b>Taxi driver:</b></v> Thanks. Have a good flight!

00:01:22.548 --> 00:01:24.761
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> I need to hurry. I’m late!

00:01:35.873 --> 00:01:41.337
<v><b>Announcement:</b></v> This is the final call for flight BA641 to London Heathrow.

00:01:41.602 --> 00:01:45.329
Would all passengers please proceed to gate B5?